    "Some records are qualitative or lack a specified bioavailability type, but numeric absolute and ordinary-condition records consistently exceed 20%.",
    "Sulpiride shows a wide range (10–70%), but its mean of ~35% still supports the high prediction; variability is a minor uncertainty."
  ],
